    },
    {
      "scenario": "independent two-drawer and Extra money arithmetic",
      "observed": "Each $300 drawer keeps its own $100 and turns in $200; two give $400; $20 Extra money raises only day/Z to $420 while drawer/shift Toast comparisons stay zero; blank Z differs from real zero; wire model has no device entry metadata"
    },
    {
      "scenario": "drawer lifecycle and negative turn-in",
